 * {{Symbol|Target|Area}}
** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*** Grants a {{#var:Static Storm value4}}-second {{#var:Static Storm value1}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Static Storm value1 tal}}|20tal}})-radius [[flying vision]] centered within the radius upon cast.
** {{Symbol|Aura}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Both the {{M|silence}} and {{Symbol|bonus agh}} the {{M|mute}} are provided by an [[aura]].
**** {{cf|aghnotes}} Static Storm checks if Disruptor has the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} when the affected enemy units are within the effect radius.
***** Hence, it does not update the current active instance until the affected enemy exit and reenter the effect radius.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
** Does not affect the following units:
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.

* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value per instance is an [[Wikipedia:Arithmetic progression|arithmetic progression]] over the entire duration, where the initial term {{Code|a<sub>1</sub>}} is the same as the common difference ({{Code|d}}).
** {{Symbol|a|up}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} ... {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}}
*** Increases by {{calc|v1*{{#var:Static Storm value4}}/{{#var:Static Storm value2}}^2 round3|v1={{#var:Static Storm value3}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Static Storm value4}}/{{#var:Static Storm value2}}^2 round3|v1={{#var:Static Storm value3 tal}}}}|15tal}}) damage per {{#expr:{{#var:Static Storm value4}}/{{#var:Static Storm value2}}}}-second intervals.
*** {{Code|[[Wikipedia:Arithmetic progression|a]]<sub>1</sub> {{=}} d }}
*** The N<sup>th</sup> damage instance is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|f(n) × Max[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] × Duration / Instance ^ 2}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Static Storm icon0}}
| desc = Creates a damaging static storm that also silences all enemy units in the area for the duration.  The damage starts off weak, but increases in power over the duration.
}}
